{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teeny Tidy is an idle game where a little robot cleans your room whilst you work, focus, or relax. Customize the room with countless options, with different aspects of customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cleaning Buddy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your own cleaning robot</strong>. Whilst completing your day-to-day tasks, your robot friend helps you clean your little desktop room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923040/extras/59e7eb79ec9c643b5dd13fd4820269c6.poster.avif?t=1756092955\" width=636 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923040/extras/59e7eb79ec9c643b5dd13fd4820269c6.webm?t=1756092955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923040/extras/59e7eb79ec9c643b5dd13fd4820269c6.mp4?t=1756092955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Help Clean Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Give your robot a hand</strong>. You\u2019re more than welcome to give your little robot a hand with cleaning up. Just click on different items in the room and take that workload away from your cleaning buddy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923040/extras/75fff67bcb1df31eb71edd6ec95ac09a.poster.avif?t=1756092955\" width=636 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923040/extras/75fff67bcb1df31eb71edd6ec95ac09a.webm?t=1756092955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923040/extras/75fff67bcb1df31eb71edd6ec95ac09a.mp4?t=1756092955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customise your room!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create amazing rooms!</strong> The more you clean, the more you earn, and you can spend that coin on purchasing new furniture from the built-in website and see what cool designs you can make!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923040/extras/3f7ce6e9ebcc3ccbe421d61d276d74bb.poster.avif?t=1756092955\" width=636 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923040/extras/3f7ce6e9ebcc3ccbe421d61d276d74bb.webm?t=1756092955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923040/extras/3f7ce6e9ebcc3ccbe421d61d276d74bb.mp4?t=1756092955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3923040?t=1756092955","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923040/6260fc7d42524ae28b10acc14a125b9c844d6314/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756092955","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923040/1af4c0775ddc8dffa492c9d6353ec11e1a736108/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756092955","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923040/1af4c0775ddc8dffa492c9d6353ec11e1a736108/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756092955","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teeny Tidy is an idle game where a little robot cleans your room whilst you work, focus, or relax. Customize the room 